TI  - GPT-4: a new era of artificial intelligence in medicine.
PG  - 3197-3200
LID - 10.1007/s11845-023-03377-8 [doi]
AB  - GPT-4 is the latest version of ChatGPT which is reported by OpenAI to have 
      greater problem-solving abilities and an even broader knowledge base. We examined 
      GPT-4's ability to inform us about the latest literature in a given area, and to 
      write a discharge summary for a patient following an uncomplicated surgery and 
      its latest image analysis feature which was reported to be able to identify 
      objects in photos. All things considered, GPT-4 has the potential to help drive 
      medical innovation, from aiding with patient discharge notes, summarizing recent 
      clinical trials, providing information on ethical guidelines, and much more.
