AB  - We, the Editor-in-Chief and Publisher of Disability and Rehabilitation: Assistive 
      Technology, have retracted the following articles, which were published as part 
      of a planned Special Issue titled "AI empowered Assistive Technology" and edited 
      by Uzair Aslam Bhatti: Liu, Y., & Long, T. (2025). How does social media shape 
      the duration of formal care for disabled elderly? Moderating effects based on 
      digital competence and psychological expectancy. Disability and Rehabilitation: 
      Assistive Technology, 20(7), 2146-2159. 
      https://doi.org/10.1080/17483107.2025.2525539Lu, X., & Guo, W. (2025). Utilizing 
      artificial intelligence to enhance social connections - the alleviating effect of 
      emotionally intelligent chatbots on loneliness. Disability and Rehabilitation: 
      Assistive Technology, 1-11. 
