      Technology, 1-18. https://doi.org/10.1080/17483107.2025.2527226Ren, H., Lv, J., 
      Ren, L., & Guo, R. (2025). Optimizing the spatial allocation of pension resources 
      in downtown Shanghai: a dynamically updated genetic algorithm approach. 
      Disability and Rehabilitation: Assistive Technology, 1-14. 
      https://doi.org/10.1080/17483107.2025.2536173Kadiyala, B., Nippatla, R. P., 
